<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam trade gaps widens to $3.537 bln.</title>
<headline>Vietnam trade gaps widens to $3.537 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's trade gap widened to $3.537 billion between January 1 and September 10, the Government Statistics Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The figures showed exports in the period totalled $4.4748 billion and imports at $8.012 billion.</p>
</text>
